@startuml Ticket_State_Transition_Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontStyle bold
skinparam StateFontSize 14
skinparam StateFontStyle bold
skinparam StateAttributeFontSize 12
skinparam StateAttributeFontStyle bold
skinparam TitleFontSize 18
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam StateBorderThickness 2

title Ticket Lifecycle - State Transition Diagram

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<initial>> #e0e7ff
  BorderColor<<initial>> #667eea
  BackgroundColor<<processing>> #fef3c7
  BorderColor<<processing>> #f59e0b
  BackgroundColor<<routing>> #dbeafe
  BorderColor<<routing>> #3b82f6
  BackgroundColor<<active>> #d1fae5
  BorderColor<<active>> #10b981
  BackgroundColor<<final>> #e5e7eb
  BorderColor<<final>> #6b7280
  BackgroundColor<<error>> #fee2e2
  BorderColor<<error>> #ef4444
}

[*] --> NEW : Ticket ingested\n(ITSM webhook or CSV)

state "NEW" as NEW <<initial>>
state "CLASSIFYING" as CLASSIFYING <<processing>>
state "CLASSIFIED" as CLASSIFIED <<processing>>
state "RETRIEVING" as RETRIEVING <<processing>>
state "GENERATING" as GENERATING <<processing>>
state "EVALUATING" as EVALUATING <<processing>>

state "AUTO_RESOLVED" as AUTO_RESOLVED <<routing>>
state "ASSIGNED" as ASSIGNED <<routing>>
state "ESCALATED" as ESCALATED <<routing>>

state "IN_PROGRESS" as IN_PROGRESS <<active>>
state "REASSIGNED" as REASSIGNED <<active>>
state "RESOLVED" as RESOLVED <<active>>

state "CLOSED" as CLOSED <<final>>
state "REOPENED" as REOPENED <<error>>

' Initial processing flow
NEW --> CLASSIFYING : Embedding task triggered\n(background job)
note right of CLASSIFYING
  **Duration:** < 200ms
  **Actions:**
  - Generate 384-dim embedding
  - Fine-tuned model prediction
end note

CLASSIFYING --> CLASSIFIED : Category predicted\nconfidence calculated
note right of CLASSIFIED
  **Output:**
  - category: String
  - confidence: Float (0.0-1.0)
  - is_multi_domain: Boolean
end note

CLASSIFIED --> RETRIEVING : RAG pipeline initiated
note right of RETRIEVING
  **Duration:** < 500ms
  **Process:**
  - Hybrid retrieval (Dense + BM25)
  - MMR reranking (λ=0.7)
end note

RETRIEVING --> GENERATING : Similar tickets found\n(top-5 retrieved)
note right of GENERATING
  **Duration:** < 3 seconds
  **LLM:** Mistral-7B-Instruct
  **Output:** Resolution steps array
end note

GENERATING --> EVALUATING : Resolution created

' Routing decision point
note right of EVALUATING
  **LLM-as-Judge Scoring:**
  - Relevance: 1-5
  - Completeness: 1-5
  - Actionability: 1-5
  **Duration:** < 1 second
end note

EVALUATING --> AUTO_RESOLVED : [confidence > 0.85]\n[avg_score >= 3.5]\n**UserProxy confirms**
note on link
  **Guard Conditions:**
  - confidence_score > 0.85
  - llm_avg_score >= 3.5
  - user_confirmed == True
  **Target:** ≥25% of tickets
end note

EVALUATING --> ASSIGNED : [0.60 <= confidence <= 0.85]
note on link
  **Guard Condition:**
  - 0.60 <= confidence < 0.85
  **Action:**
  - Assign to L1/L2 department
  - Provide suggested resolution
  **Target:** 60-70% of tickets
end note

EVALUATING --> ESCALATED : [confidence < 0.60]\n[OR is_multi_domain == True]
note on link
  **Guard Conditions:**
  - confidence_score < 0.60
  - OR is_multi_domain flag set
  **Action:**
  - Route to L2/L3 specialist
  - Include context package
  **Target:** 5-15% of tickets
  **Accuracy Target:** ≥90%
end note

' Auto-resolve path
AUTO_RESOLVED --> CLOSED : Verified by system\nFeedback = accepted
note on link
  **Action:**
  - Update KB if accepted
  - Close ticket
  - Notify ITSM
end note

AUTO_RESOLVED --> ASSIGNED : UserProxy rejects\nauto-resolution
note on link
  **Fallback:**
  Route to L1 for manual review
end note

' Department route path
ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : L1/L2 agent\naccepts ticket
note on link
  **Action:**
  - Notify agent (Email + Slack)
  - Start SLA timer
end note

' Escalation path
ESCALATED --> IN_PROGRESS : L2/L3 specialist\naccepts ticket
note on link
  **Action:**
  - Urgent notification
  - Provide full context package
end note

' Active work states
IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : Agent provides\nsolution
note on link
  **Action:**
  - Store resolution
  - Request verification
end note

IN_PROGRESS --> REASSIGNED : Incorrect routing\ndetected
note on link
  **Trigger:**
  - Agent identifies wrong department
  - Multi-domain complexity discovered
end note

REASSIGNED --> ASSIGNED : Route to correct\ndepartment
note on link
  **Action:**
  - Re-classify if needed
  - Log routing error
end note

REASSIGNED --> ESCALATED : Needs specialist\nexpertise
note on link
  **Action:**
  - Upgrade priority
  - Assign to L2/L3
end note

' Resolution to closure
RESOLVED --> CLOSED : Requester verifies\nsolution works
note on link
  **Action:**
  - Request feedback
  - Update knowledge base
  - Close in ITSM
end note

' Rare edge case
CLOSED --> REOPENED : User/agent reopens\n(solution failed)
note on link
  **Rare:** < 5% target
  **Trigger:**
  - Solution didn't work
  - Issue recurred
end note

REOPENED --> IN_PROGRESS : Reassigned for\nrework
note on link
  **Action:**
  - Escalate priority
  - Assign to original agent
end note

' Final state
CLOSED --> [*] : Ticket lifecycle\ncomplete

note bottom
  **State Metrics:**
  - Total Resolution Time Target: < 2 hours (NEW → CLOSED)
  - Auto-Resolve Accuracy: ≥ 95%
  - Reopen Rate: < 5%
  
  **Logging:**
  All transitions logged to routing_history table
  for audit and performance analysis
end note

@enduml
